0-08-26T15:55:13Z","body":"looks like indeed we have a bug. this affects all 7.x versions. I think #46654  is not related - the problem can be reproduced in 7.4 without that change.\r\nIt is caused because of how we default values in https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/blob/master/server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/common/time/JavaDateFormatter.java#L52\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/comments/653397968/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"pgomulka","id":11137008,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTM3MDA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11137008?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pgomulka","html_url":"https://github.com/pgomulka","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pgomulka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pgomulka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pgomulka/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pgomulka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pgomulka/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pgomulka/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pgomulka/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pgomulka/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pgomulka/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/comments/653401564","html_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/58986#issuecomment-653401564","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/58986","id":653401564,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY1MzQwMTU2NA==","user":{"login":"pgomulka","id":11137008,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTM3